Nura - Learn. Focus, Grow
 Nura is designed to help students discover 
 effective study methods and also to help the user to develop healthy
 learning habits. 

 The website allows the user to explore a range 
 of study methods, including active learning,
 time management, memory techniques and wellness
 strategies. It aims to make studying easier and more effective by helping 
 students find approaches that suit their individual learning needs.

Nura's goal is to guide students towards more effective, organised and 
confident learning through simple resources and an easy-to-navigate website.

Built using: HTML and CSS.
